<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Bikaner to Bagdogra | Rajasthan to North Bengal
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the price for Car Transport From Bikaner To Bagdogra calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The price is derived from a combination of base freight charges, distance‑based fuel surcharge, toll fees, insurance premium, and any additional packaging or handling services you request. Shree Ashirwad applies GST on the total invoice and provides a transparent itemised quote, ensuring you understand every cost component before confirming the booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures does Shree Ashirwad use to prevent scratches during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad employs a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system, hydraulic ramp loading with wheel chocks, anti‑scratch deck surfaces, and IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. Real‑time GPS tracking monitors the vehicle’s journey, and trained loading crews follow a zero‑scratch protocol, guaranteeing that your car arrives without any surface damage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it moves from Bikaner to Bagdogra?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every carrier in Shree Ashirwad’s fleet is equipped with satellite‑enabled GPS devices. Once your car is loaded, you receive a secure tracking link that lets you monitor its exact location, speed, and estimated arrival time, providing full visibility throughout the 850 km transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on the type or size of vehicles that can be shipped on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The service accommodates most passenger cars, SUVs, and light commercial vehicles up to 2.5 tonnes GVW. Oversized or high‑clearance vehicles may require a custom quote and specialized carrier. Shree Ashirwad’s multi‑axle express freight trailers can handle a wide range of dimensions, but we advise confirming vehicle specifications during the booking process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents do I need to provide for interstate car transport and why are they important?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You must submit the vehicle’s registration certificate, valid insurance policy, a signed owner’s consent form, GST invoice, and an e‑Way bill for the cargo. These documents satisfy RTO, customs, and tax regulations, ensuring smooth clearance at state borders and preventing delays or penalties during the Bikaner‑to‑Bagdogra journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the entire relocation process take, from booking to delivery, for a car moving from Bikaner to Bagdogra?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Typically, the process spans 3‑5 business days. Booking and documentation take 1‑2 days, followed by a scheduled pickup and door‑to‑door loading. The highway transit averages 12‑14 hours, with additional time for customs checks and final delivery. Shree Ashirwad’s efficient coordination often compresses the timeline to the lower end of this range.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
